# Visual Frontend & Game World Implementation Plan

> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** Implement a gamified "Enterprise" interface using Next.js and Phaser.js, where AI agents are represented as pixel-art characters in specialized offices, reacting in real-time to the backend's state.

**Architecture:** A React-based shell (Next.js) wrapping a Phaser.js game canvas. The game world synchronizes with the Python backend via WebSockets, updating agent animations and positions based on the `AgentState`.

**Tech Stack:** Next.js, Phaser.js, Tailwind CSS, Lucide-React, WebSockets (Socket.io or native).

**Spec:** `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-19-agentes-ia-trading-enterprise-design.md`

## Global Constraints
- **Visual Style:** Pixel Art / Stardew Valley aesthetic.
- **Real-time Sync:** Agent visual states (Idle, Working, Alert) must mirror backend `AgentState` via WebSockets.
- **Responsiveness:** The game canvas should scale to the browser window while maintaining the pixel-art aspect ratio.
- **Interface:** UI panels (Chat, Strategy Builder) must be overlays on top of the game world.

---

## File Structure

### Frontend Core
- `src/frontend/pages/index.tsx`: Main entry point.
- `src/frontend/components/GameContainer.tsx`: Wrapper for the Phaser game instance.
- `src/frontend/components/UIOverlay.tsx`: Manager for chat and strategy panels.

### Phaser Game Logic (`/src/frontend/game/`)
- `src/frontend/game/main.ts`: Phaser game configuration and scene management.
- `src/frontend/game/scenes/OfficeScene.ts`: The main office world logic.
- `src/frontend/game/entities/AgentEntity.ts`: The "Personita" class (state machine, animations).
- `src/frontend/game/entities/OfficeObject.ts`: Interactive objects (Computers, Coffee Machine).
- `src/frontend/game/systems/SocketSystem.ts`: WebSocket client for real-time updates.
- `src/frontend/game/assets/Assets.ts`: Asset manifest (spritesheets, tilesets).

### UI Components (`/src/frontend/components/ui/`)
- `src/frontend/components/ui/ChatPanel.tsx`: Chat interface for talking to agents.
- `src/frontend/components/ui/StrategyBuilder.tsx`: Interactive form for strategy conditions.
- `src/frontend/components/ui/StatusHUD.tsx`: Top-bar showing overall system health.

